     DDeelleettee
          unlinks a file after confirmation; a directory must be
          empty and is removed with rrmmddiirr.

     MMkkddiirr
          runs mmkkddiirr with the typed name, relative to the current
          directory.

     GGoo   changes to a typed absolute path.

     The directory is rescanned automatically every 5 seconds
     when it changes on disk; the selection is kept by name.

