DDIIAAGGNNOOSSTTIICCSS
     All diagnostics appear in dialogs, among them: `Cannot enter
     that directory', `Can only copy an ordinary file', `Cannot
     move there (other file system?)', `That directory is not
     empty', `Give an absolute path (starting /)', `Copy failed
     (disk full?)'.

NNOOTTEESS
     The list holds at most 160 entries; a bigger directory is
     truncated and the count reads `160+ entries'.  File names
     show at most 14 characters and paths may be at most 119
     characters.  Dot-files are listed (only .  and ..  are hid-
     den).  There is no facility for running arbitrary programs
     from zzffiillee.
